<p>Notes: Gables Residential Trust's  extraordinary loss, net for the nine months ended Sept 30, 1996, represents the write-off of unamortized deferred financing costs associated with the March, 1996 refinancing of the Company's original credit facility that was scheduled to mature in January, 1997. In connection therewith, the Company closed on a new $175 million unsecured revolving credit facility.  The extraordinary loss totaling $631,000 is presented net of the $111,000 portion of the loss attributable to the minority interest unitholders in the Operating Partnership.</p>
